  "symbol": "scene_keyboard_notes",
  "notes": "Press F1 in any other scene to edit a note. Type with a keyboard or use D-pad + A. B deletes, Select changes the keyboard page, and Start/Enter saves. Escape or the on-screen cancel key returns without changing the note. The 64-element global array holds 63 characters plus a terminator and persists between visits.",
